{"id":2224,"date":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2224"},"modified":"2025-10-02T09:44:59","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T09:44:59","slug":"hexagon-cardboard-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/hexagon-cardboard-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Hexagon Cardboard Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>Unique Hexagon Cardboard Boxes for Packaging<\/h2>\n<p>We at <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><strong><em>Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/em><\/strong><\/a> manufacture unique and reliable <strong>hexagon cardboard boxes<\/strong> that offer a different shape for packaging that stands out. Whether you&#8217;re packaging gifts, cosmetics, confections, or promotional items, these boxes work well for brands looking to use compact and symmetrical designs.<\/p>\n<p>Our <strong>custom hexagon boxes<\/strong> are made to order in your desired size, printing style, and material. From rigid lid-and-base boxes to foldable carton styles, we support full customization with low minimums and fast turnaround times. You also get access to free design support and nationwide shipping at no extra charge.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Structure and Style Built for Creative Packaging<\/h2>\n<h3>A Practical Solution with a Unique Look<\/h3>\n<p>Hexagon cardboard boxes are ideal for brands needing compact storage while maintaining an attractive look. This six-sided shape offers natural symmetry and is commonly used for packaging candles, soap bars, dry foods, retail samples, and handmade gifts.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Made from recyclable cardboard, Kraft, or white SBS<\/li>\n<li>Easy to stack, store, and assemble<\/li>\n<li>Custom lids, inserts, or base closures available<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>You can also use these boxes for event giveaways or as branded packaging for small product bundles.<\/p>\n<h3>Designed to Fit a Range of Product Types<\/h3>\n<p>The hexagonal shape provides more design freedom compared to traditional square or rectangular boxes. Whether you want tuck-top styles or lid-and-base formats, every <strong>custom hexagon box<\/strong> can be made to your exact dimensions.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Choose flat foldable options or rigid assembled boxes<\/li>\n<li>Add custom inserts for candles, vials, or food jars<\/li>\n<li>Interior printing available for promotional messaging<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Boxes can be printed both inside and outside using CMYK or Pantone colors.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Hexagon Cardboard Boxes<\/h2>\n<table style=\"height: 407px;\" width=\"907\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Description<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Box Shape<\/td>\n<td>Hexagon (Six-sided), with optional base and lid variations<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Options<\/td>\n<td>Kraft Board, Corrugated, White SBS, Bux Board<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dimensions<\/td>\n<td>Fully Customizable (Diameter and Height)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Styles Available<\/td>\n<td>Tuck Top, Seal End, Lid &amp; Base, Foldable Die-Cut<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Printing Options<\/td>\n<td>CMYK, PMS, Inside &amp; Outside Printing<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Coating Finishes<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Closure Types<\/td>\n<td>Friction Lid, Magnetic Closure, Tuck-In Tabs<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Insert Options<\/td>\n<td>Foam, Cardboard Divider, Paper Cushions<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MOQ<\/td>\n<td>Starts at 100 Units<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Turnaround Time<\/td>\n<td>4\u20136 Business Days Standard (Rush Options Available)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Proof Format<\/td>\n<td>Flat View, 3D Mock-up, or Physical Sample<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shipping<\/td>\n<td>Free Nationwide Delivery<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Design Support<\/td>\n<td>Free Artwork and Custom Layout Assistance<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Hexagon Boxes Wholesale for Bulk Requirements<\/h2>\n<h3>Bulk Packaging for Retail and E-commerce Use<\/h3>\n<p>If you handle high-volume orders or seasonal sales, ordering <strong>hexagon boxes wholesale<\/strong> helps manage cost and supply efficiently. These boxes are easy to label, stack, and ship across different sales platforms.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Lower per-unit cost on high-quantity orders<\/li>\n<li>Consistent size and printing for brand identity<\/li>\n<li>Ready inventory for high-demand seasons<\/li>\n<li>Reorder support using saved templates<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>We\u2019ve helped clients across gifting, skincare, and organic food segments source <strong>hexagon cardboard boxes for sale<\/strong> at affordable bulk rates.<\/p>\n<h3>Designed for Both Small and Large Items<\/h3>\n<p>Whether you&#8217;re looking for <strong>large hexagon cardboard boxes<\/strong> to pack gift sets or compact formats for product samples, we can manufacture boxes that match your usage.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Great for bath kits, candles, confectionery, or accessories<\/li>\n<li>Ideal for corporate promotional kits or holiday packaging<\/li>\n<li>Available with top-opening or slide lid styles<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>If you have a specific layout in mind, you can even provide your own <strong>hexagon box template<\/strong>, and we\u2019ll manufacture based on the structure and fold lines you supply.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"224\">Find More Options in Medium Sizes<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"226\" data-end=\"711\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">If you are searching for packaging with moderate dimensions or need something with a more standard shape for wider product lines, our <strong data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"452\"><a class=\"cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/medium-cardboard-boxes\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"362\" data-end=\"450\">Medium Cardboard Boxes<\/a><\/strong> offer a balanced solution. These boxes are suitable for mid-sized items and share the same quality materials and finishing options available with our custom hexagon packaging. You can view them as part of our shape-based range for flexible packaging choices.<\/p>\n<h2>Coating and Print Options to Improve Presentation<\/h2>\n<h3>Finishing That Adds More Than Looks<\/h3>\n<p>Each hexagon box can be finished to meet durability and design needs. Whether you want to increase shelf appeal or protect the ink from wear, we offer:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gloss coating for shine and color vibrancy<\/li>\n<li>Matte finish for a smooth, non-reflective surface<\/li>\n<li>Spot UV to make logos or highlights stand out<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>These coatings also help protect against moisture, smudging, and surface wear during shipping or retail handling.<\/p>\n<h3>High-Quality Printing on Any Panel<\/h3>\n<p>All six sides of the box can be printed with your branding, logos, taglines, or product instructions. We use modern printing systems to ensure sharp visuals and consistent color reproduction.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>CMYK for photographic and colorful artwork<\/li>\n<li>PMS for brand-specific color accuracy<\/li>\n<li>Interior panel printing and text additions available<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>You can also choose minimal designs or request edge-to-edge coverage based on your brand style.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>A Variety of Shapes in One Category<\/h2>\n<p>If you&#8217;re organizing packaging by dimensions or unique formats, our <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/cardboard-boxes-by-size-and-shape\/\"><strong>Cardboard Boxes by Size and Shape<\/strong><\/a> collection helps you view all available options in one place. This category includes rectangle, cube, round, and hexagon box formats to simplify multi-SKU packaging.<\/p>\n<p>You can group your <strong>hexagon cardboard boxes with lids<\/strong> alongside other packaging solutions to streamline your fulfillment setup and shelf layout.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Why Shop Cardboard Boxes is the Right Fit for Hexagon Packaging<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Custom hexagon boxes for gifting, shipping, or retail<\/li>\n<li>Free design support and box layout guidance<\/li>\n<li>Coating options including Gloss, Matte, and Spot UV<\/li>\n<li>Boxes available with lids, inserts, or interior printing<\/li>\n<li>Fast turnaround and free nationwide delivery<\/li>\n<li>Eco-conscious material choices upon request<\/li>\n<li>Competitive rates on <strong>hexagon cardboard boxes wholesale<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Request your quote today and start packaging with unique Hexagon Cardboard Boxes from Shop Cardboard Boxes.<\/strong><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Shop Cardboard Boxes offers Hexagon Cardboard Boxes at wholesale prices, designed to meet your packaging needs with custom sizes and styles. Our hexagon cardboard boxes are made from high-quality materials and are available in a variety of sizes and styles. We offer various printing options, including gloss, matte, and spot UV. We also offer free design and shipping. Custom sizes and styles are available. Fast turnaround times. High-quality material &amp; printing options etc. Contact us today to learn more about our hexagon cardboard boxes.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2281,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[179],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2224","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-cardboard-boxes-by-size-and-shape","rishi-post","first","instock","shipping-taxable","purchasable","product-type-simple"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.9 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Buy Hexagon Cardboard Boxes And Wholesale Packaging<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Unique hexagon cardboard boxes for standout packaging. Custom sizes, high-quality materials, and fast turnaround times. Perfect for unique products.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, fol